category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libgsl-devel libprng-devel librngstreams-devel
sdesc: "Universal Non-Uniform Random number generator (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "UNU.RAN (Universal Non-Uniform RAndom Number generator) is a collection of
algorithms for generating non-uniform pseudorandom variates as a library of C
functions designed and implemented by the ARVAG (Automatic Random VAriate
Generation) project group in Vienna, and released under the GNU Public License
(GPL)."
skip:

homepage: https://statmath.wu.ac.at/unuran/
license: GPL-2.0-or-later
